        "Probes A13, RT13 and RT13n and cases FV-C08, FV-C09, FV-C19 are unchanged."
      ],
      "regression_methods": [
        "test_RA04_statement_revision_holds_each_item_and_requires_non_supplier_acceptance",
        "test_RA04_statement_replacement_key_preserves_revision_control"
      ],
      "independent_probe": "X12s"
